WEBVTT

01:26.420 --> 01:29.660
[Glory]

01:30.640 --> 01:32.920
[Episode 33]

01:35.640 --> 01:37.870
Father, in all my years

01:37.870 --> 01:39.120
I have never

01:39.120 --> 01:40.720
suffered such humiliation.

01:41.350 --> 01:42.430
After all, I am

01:42.430 --> 01:44.000
your daughter, Father.

01:44.710 --> 01:45.509
I was personally

01:45.509 --> 01:48.110
ennobled as
Princess Jinxiang by the Emperor.

01:49.150 --> 01:50.640
She's merely a merchant's daughter,

01:50.640 --> 01:52.370
yet she dares to be so arrogant.

01:53.039 --> 01:53.789
You've made

01:53.789 --> 01:55.870
tremendous contributions to the court.

01:55.870 --> 01:58.350
You are the Emperor's
most trusted minister.

01:58.350 --> 02:00.040
If your son wanted a wife,

02:00.510 --> 02:02.790
any imperial princess or
daughter of the great houses

02:02.790 --> 02:04.680
would have been his for the choosing.

02:04.680 --> 02:05.680
But instead,

02:06.280 --> 02:07.560
he rejected them all

02:08.000 --> 02:09.400
and chose this demoness.

02:09.780 --> 02:11.740
He nearly struck his own cousin.

02:12.310 --> 02:13.840
If you won't stand up for me,

02:14.560 --> 02:15.400
is it because you fear

02:15.400 --> 02:16.730
that imperial jade seal

02:17.390 --> 02:19.110
or that insolent woman?

02:19.130 --> 02:19.940
Enough!

02:33.030 --> 02:34.890
Father, you no longer care for me.

02:35.000 --> 02:36.910
You allow outsiders to bully me,

02:37.690 --> 02:39.690
and you will not even stand up for me.

02:40.960 --> 02:43.020
I was widowed at the age of seventeen.

02:43.850 --> 02:44.570
Once,

02:45.490 --> 02:47.290
Father, you cared for me.

02:48.340 --> 02:49.090
But now,

02:51.560 --> 02:53.820
even you no longer show me any affection.

02:58.079 --> 02:59.079
Then what's the point

02:59.079 --> 03:00.430
of my living?

03:00.630 --> 03:02.040
I might as well die.

03:04.280 --> 03:05.880
I know you have been wronged.

03:09.470 --> 03:11.120
You're quite fond of my

03:11.190 --> 03:13.190
ruby-inlaid saber set, aren't you?

03:13.710 --> 03:14.770
I'll give it to you.

03:15.540 --> 03:16.400
I don't want it.

03:17.420 --> 03:19.230
Stop this nonsense!

03:20.750 --> 03:22.190
I know everything about

03:22.190 --> 03:23.770
what happened at Hanyu Courtyard today.

03:23.770 --> 03:25.290
It was your insolent words

03:25.710 --> 03:26.400
that provoked her

03:26.400 --> 03:27.960
to bring out the imperial jade seal.

03:27.960 --> 03:29.280
You brought this humiliation
upon yourself.

03:29.280 --> 03:30.340
Do you understand?

03:31.590 --> 03:33.120
Founding Emperor's decree

03:33.870 --> 03:35.000
cannot be defied even by

03:35.000 --> 03:36.200
the present Emperor.

03:37.000 --> 03:38.600
She spared your life

03:38.630 --> 03:40.140
out of respect for me.

03:41.310 --> 03:42.840
Yingchuan, remember this.

03:44.079 --> 03:46.590
This piece must be held
firmly in your grasp.

03:46.840 --> 03:47.910
Whether it bends or stands straight,

03:47.910 --> 03:48.680
resists or submits,

03:48.680 --> 03:50.480
so long as it serves its purpose.

03:50.520 --> 03:51.850
Keep her under control,

03:52.430 --> 03:54.560
and Jianglai will eventually submit.

03:55.670 --> 03:56.640
I warn you.

03:57.550 --> 03:58.880
Don't ruin my plans.

03:59.829 --> 04:01.420
Otherwise, even though
you are my daughter,

04:01.420 --> 04:02.630
I will not spare you.

04:08.870 --> 04:09.710
Father.

04:10.190 --> 04:11.910
Would it not invite ridicule

04:12.310 --> 04:13.710
to bring such an unfilial

04:14.190 --> 04:16.320
and unvirtuous woman into our family?

04:18.920 --> 04:20.070
It's just women's

04:20.070 --> 04:21.390
petty squabbles.

04:21.870 --> 04:23.470
How significant could it be?

04:24.650 --> 04:26.180
Once she marries Jianglai,

04:26.360 --> 04:29.020
the jade seal will belong
to Jianglai's family.

04:29.070 --> 04:31.030
Whose rules she will follow

04:31.050 --> 04:32.650
will become clear with time.

04:33.550 --> 04:35.210
How could a mere fragile woman

04:35.620 --> 04:36.310
possibly stand against

04:36.310 --> 04:37.920
the ways of this world?

04:40.990 --> 04:41.920
So naive.

04:45.680 --> 04:46.360
Father.

04:47.550 --> 04:49.880
Are you truly going to
grant the title to…?

04:55.790 --> 04:56.800
I'm only

04:56.800 --> 04:58.600
worried about Mother's health.

04:59.070 --> 05:01.480
She hasn't been well lately.

05:01.740 --> 05:03.670
After being angered by that woman,

05:03.920 --> 05:05.720
she couldn't even get out of bed.

05:07.750 --> 05:08.430
Is that so?

05:11.720 --> 05:12.870
She's ill again?

05:19.010 --> 05:25.180
[Baoshi Hall]

05:32.390 --> 05:34.390
Come, follow me to Fuping Pavilion.

05:59.150 --> 06:01.360
[Fuping Pavilion]

06:02.480 --> 06:03.280
Master Shuyu.

06:03.560 --> 06:04.960
His Highness has spoken.

06:05.110 --> 06:06.740
The Xue family has few descendants.

06:06.740 --> 06:08.140
You two are his only sons.

06:08.330 --> 06:09.540
As brothers,

06:09.710 --> 06:11.040
you should stand united

06:11.270 --> 06:12.600
and support each other,

06:12.770 --> 06:13.680
and together

06:13.680 --> 06:15.080
uphold the family honor.

06:15.610 --> 06:16.740
I don't understand.

06:17.950 --> 06:18.810
Father's words

06:19.480 --> 06:20.880
have left me confused.

06:22.480 --> 06:23.680
What have I done wrong

06:24.360 --> 06:27.420
that he would punish me
by making me kneel facing north?

06:27.430 --> 06:28.850
Please enlighten me, Steward Xue.

06:28.850 --> 06:30.240
His Highness is firmly resolved

06:30.240 --> 06:31.900
to have Master Jianglai
formally reinstated into the family.

06:31.900 --> 06:33.590
Yet you are unwilling and
have obstructed it at every turn,

06:33.590 --> 06:34.680
attempting to drive Miss Rong away

06:34.680 --> 06:36.120
and expel Master Jianglai.

06:36.120 --> 06:36.720
That would

06:36.720 --> 06:37.920
only be possible

06:37.920 --> 06:39.780
if the impossible were to happen.

06:39.920 --> 06:41.310
The Duke's mind is made up.

06:41.310 --> 06:42.430
Once he's decided on something,

06:42.430 --> 06:43.630
it cannot be changed.

06:43.880 --> 06:45.040
If you insist on stirring up

06:45.040 --> 06:47.240
discord between you two in front of him,

06:47.440 --> 06:49.240
how could he possibly spare you?

06:52.400 --> 06:54.600
My ailment is in my legs.

06:56.050 --> 06:57.240
I can barely walk

06:57.920 --> 06:59.320
and am ashamed to be seen.

07:00.520 --> 07:03.070
Let alone visiting Mother
at Hanyu Courtyard,

07:03.070 --> 07:04.530
I rarely even step outside

07:05.040 --> 07:06.300
this Fuping Pavilion.

07:07.630 --> 07:09.680
Mother has always valued rules above all.

07:09.680 --> 07:11.950
She took it upon herself
to discipline Miss Rong

07:11.950 --> 07:13.810
for her temperament and conduct.

07:14.630 --> 07:16.430
What does that have to do with me?

07:17.200 --> 07:19.560
You don't often visit the Hanyu Courtyard,

07:19.560 --> 07:20.600
but Princess Jinxiang

07:20.600 --> 07:21.390
comes to

07:21.390 --> 07:23.250
the Fuping Pavilion frequently.

07:27.750 --> 07:30.080
Father cherishes his precious daughter,

07:30.310 --> 07:31.500
yet the consequences

07:31.500 --> 07:33.510
of Xue Yingchuan's pride and arrogance

07:33.510 --> 07:35.040
must be borne by me as well.

07:35.700 --> 07:37.159
Does Father truly believe

07:37.200 --> 07:39.200
that I incited her to cause trouble,

07:39.870 --> 07:41.130
or that I could presume

07:41.409 --> 07:43.470
to control Mother's words and deeds?

07:46.970 --> 07:47.630
He surely holds me

07:47.630 --> 07:48.890
in far too high regard.

07:49.390 --> 07:50.430
Disorder in the household

07:50.430 --> 07:51.890
often breeds misfortune.

07:52.680 --> 07:53.480
Master Shuyu.

07:53.750 --> 07:55.060
His Highness has instructed you

07:55.060 --> 07:56.610
to kneel here until cockcrow.

07:56.610 --> 07:58.010
Please stop complaining

07:58.040 --> 07:59.370
and save your strength.

08:27.920 --> 08:29.560
Master Shuyu is already injured

08:29.560 --> 08:30.640
and shouldn't kneel for long.

08:30.640 --> 08:31.070
Might it be possible…

08:31.070 --> 08:31.600
Get lost!

08:46.450 --> 08:48.420
With Master Shuyu punished in this way,

08:48.420 --> 08:49.120
I do not know how many

08:49.120 --> 08:51.320
in the household will end up suffering.

09:08.230 --> 09:09.030
Master Shuyu!

09:09.870 --> 09:10.670
Master Shuyu.

09:11.100 --> 09:11.670
Brother.

09:28.510 --> 09:29.910
How did you know it was me?

09:30.750 --> 09:32.080
I heard your footsteps.

09:32.790 --> 09:33.590
You're lying.

09:34.720 --> 09:35.960
When I came in,

09:36.510 --> 09:37.910
you were lost in thought.

09:41.140 --> 09:42.960
Weren't you going to visit Master Shuyu?

09:42.960 --> 09:45.090
Why have you come back looking so glum?

09:46.910 --> 09:48.270
You are brothers,

09:48.670 --> 09:49.550
bound by blood,

09:50.470 --> 09:52.330
yet he did not embrace you in tears

09:52.510 --> 09:54.110
nor pour out his heart to you.

09:54.750 --> 09:55.870
Instead, he treated you like a guest,

09:55.870 --> 09:57.000
distant and polite.

09:57.440 --> 09:59.240
The Duke's heir you met

09:59.550 --> 10:00.550
is quite different from

10:00.550 --> 10:01.620
the refined brother

10:01.620 --> 10:02.620
you had imagined,

10:03.480 --> 10:04.320
isn't he?

10:08.360 --> 10:08.840
I...

10:11.600 --> 10:13.270
I laugh at you for seeing so little

10:13.270 --> 10:14.470
of what's before you.

10:14.600 --> 10:16.150
Master Shuyu, burdened by
his leg ailment, avoids society

10:16.150 --> 10:17.390
and rarely appears before others.

10:17.390 --> 10:18.920
But the Duke is getting old,

10:18.930 --> 10:21.000
and his estate cannot
be left without an heir.

10:21.000 --> 10:22.200
So he spares no effort

10:22.200 --> 10:23.890
in forcing you to return to the family.

10:23.890 --> 10:25.470
But if you truly acknowledge
him as your father,

10:25.470 --> 10:27.700
Master Shuyu will fall from favor,
and then lose his title.

10:27.700 --> 10:29.420
Left in such an awkward position,

10:29.420 --> 10:30.080
how is he supposed to

10:30.080 --> 10:31.540
face you, his own brother?

10:33.080 --> 10:34.270
Don't tell me

10:34.750 --> 10:36.550
you're not here to compete for the title.

10:36.550 --> 10:37.680
That's not up to you.

10:42.120 --> 10:42.920
Rong Shanbao.

10:44.080 --> 10:45.280
What brings you here?

10:46.320 --> 10:47.120
I told you already.

10:47.120 --> 10:49.000
Don't try to fool me with those words.

10:49.000 --> 10:50.000
If you intended to strike
back at the Duke's household,

10:50.000 --> 10:51.260
there were other ways.

10:51.480 --> 10:52.740
But you came in person,

10:54.150 --> 10:56.060
patiently dealing with people,

10:57.160 --> 10:58.980
listening to their nonsensical chatter.

10:58.980 --> 10:59.790
Where do you find

10:59.790 --> 11:01.320
such leisure and patience?

11:01.560 --> 11:03.160
What is it you truly came for?

11:04.750 --> 11:06.200
The trivial matters in the capital

11:06.200 --> 11:08.010
are all handled by Yunshu and Yunling.

11:08.010 --> 11:09.810
They are excellent assistants.

11:10.100 --> 11:11.960
So I don't need to oversee
everything personally.

11:11.960 --> 11:13.680
With this rare moment of leisure,

11:13.680 --> 11:14.840
I came specifically

11:15.560 --> 11:17.750
to see you, Lord Lu, tossing and turning,

11:17.750 --> 11:19.010
your heart in torment,

11:19.200 --> 11:21.820
torn between choices,
hesitant and indecisive.

11:21.820 --> 11:23.780
And to see you
struggling between family ties

11:23.780 --> 11:25.380
and wealth and power,

11:26.120 --> 11:26.910
torn between

11:26.910 --> 11:28.550
choosing your full brother

11:29.100 --> 11:31.030
or that exalted seat of authority.

11:32.320 --> 11:34.630
After all, with a single nod,

11:35.270 --> 11:37.060
purple robes and jade belts will be yours,

11:37.060 --> 11:38.520
and you will rise to high rank.

11:38.520 --> 11:40.080
You will no longer need to struggle

11:40.080 --> 11:41.280
or scheme endlessly,

11:41.600 --> 11:42.670
entangled with those

11:42.670 --> 11:44.670
contemptible figures of the world.

11:45.630 --> 11:46.840
You can fully display your talents

11:46.840 --> 11:48.240
in your official career,

11:48.390 --> 11:50.630
and your name will be recorded in history.

11:50.630 --> 11:51.550
It will repay the long years

11:51.550 --> 11:53.610
of suffering endured by your mother,

11:53.690 --> 11:55.390
the humiliations you suffered

11:55.390 --> 11:57.980
because of your humble birth,

11:58.430 --> 11:59.960
and all the lofty ambitions

12:00.520 --> 12:01.970
you have long harbored.

12:04.800 --> 12:05.440
Who is it?

12:05.590 --> 12:07.110
My Lady, it's me.

12:12.600 --> 12:13.440
Come in.

12:16.950 --> 12:17.500
My Lady.

12:17.950 --> 12:19.000
Just now, I went out

12:19.000 --> 12:19.920
and heard from the servants

12:19.920 --> 12:22.580
that the lady
of Hanyu Courtyard has fallen ill.

12:25.390 --> 12:26.750
We've only been talking for a while

12:26.750 --> 12:28.080
and she's already sick?

12:28.140 --> 12:29.380
She's trying to blame you

12:29.380 --> 12:30.640
and deliberately smear your reputation.

12:30.640 --> 12:31.500
Just ignore it.

12:32.550 --> 12:33.080
I don't mingle much

12:33.080 --> 12:34.880
among the ladies of the capital.

12:35.030 --> 12:37.170
My own reputation matters little.

12:38.710 --> 12:39.720
However, the Duchess

12:39.720 --> 12:41.090
is still my elder after all.

12:41.090 --> 12:42.360
If she is indeed ill because of me,

12:42.360 --> 12:44.160
I ought to go and pay my respects,

12:44.390 --> 12:45.870
so as not to damage your reputation

12:45.870 --> 12:48.550
as the Second Young Master
of the Duke's household,

12:48.550 --> 12:50.830
cause others to accuse you
of disrespecting elders,

12:50.830 --> 12:52.360
or ruin your bright future.

13:11.390 --> 13:12.150
My Lady.

13:12.600 --> 13:13.660
What's the matter?

13:15.550 --> 13:17.280
You seem different

13:17.310 --> 13:18.640
from how you are at home.

13:18.960 --> 13:20.180
your words and actions

13:20.180 --> 13:21.420
are hard to fathom.

13:21.790 --> 13:22.740
I've noticed that

13:22.740 --> 13:24.980
even Lord Lu appears confused

13:25.300 --> 13:26.610
and unsure how to respond.

13:26.610 --> 13:27.490
Just now,

13:27.520 --> 13:28.950
he stood outside the door for a long time,

13:28.950 --> 13:30.390
watching you leave.

13:30.480 --> 13:32.560
His expression was quite forlorn.

13:33.930 --> 13:35.730
I don't have any ill intentions.

13:35.960 --> 13:36.600
I came only

13:36.600 --> 13:38.260
on account of my own concerns.

13:38.480 --> 13:39.910
My Lady, are your concerns

13:39.910 --> 13:41.150
related to Lord Lu?

13:43.450 --> 13:44.910
Once he inherits the title

13:45.550 --> 13:46.600
and resumes his position

13:46.600 --> 13:47.720
as the Duke's heir,

13:48.550 --> 13:50.150
my concerns will be settled,

13:50.840 --> 13:52.120
and I will be able to return

13:52.120 --> 13:54.380
to Linji without any lingering worries.

13:54.750 --> 13:55.750
My Lady, don't you

13:56.440 --> 13:58.170
want to be with Lord Lu anymore?

13:59.360 --> 14:01.600
The Lu Jianglai
who once strove tirelessly

14:01.600 --> 14:03.260
and harbored great ambitions

14:03.700 --> 14:05.310
was never meant to be with me.

14:06.300 --> 14:08.500
The Duke's heir of Yongguo's household

14:08.690 --> 14:10.350
and the heir of the Rong family

14:10.470 --> 14:12.600
were never meant to walk the same path.

14:14.800 --> 14:16.050
Go find Cheng Guanyu

14:16.760 --> 14:17.760
and tell him to get

14:17.810 --> 14:19.870
the box of ginseng from the carriage.

14:19.890 --> 14:20.480
Yes.

14:32.060 --> 14:33.030
Have you decided

14:33.050 --> 14:34.030
what to carve on the bisque

14:34.030 --> 14:35.230
for the kiln opening?

14:35.670 --> 14:37.200
I'll have to give it some thought.

14:37.200 --> 14:38.200
Once it's carved,

14:38.230 --> 14:39.820
the clay can't be reshaped.

14:40.160 --> 14:41.400
So secretive.

14:42.550 --> 14:44.280
Perhaps only by saying nothing

14:44.440 --> 14:46.440
can I stay by her side for a lifetime.

14:48.080 --> 14:49.540
That might be for the best.

15:03.550 --> 15:06.590
[Imperial Yongguo Mansion]

15:07.290 --> 15:08.930
Madam Chang suffers from diabetes

15:08.930 --> 15:11.000
and cannot endure the slightest agitation.

15:11.000 --> 15:13.510
And now you're forcing
a sick woman to move.

15:13.830 --> 15:15.360
Where do you expect us to go?

15:15.500 --> 15:16.230
Steward Xue.

15:16.320 --> 15:17.120
How can there be

15:17.120 --> 15:18.550
such unreasonable behavior in this world?

15:18.550 --> 15:20.000
Madam Zheng,
please don't misunderstand me.

15:20.000 --> 15:21.510
My Lady, something's wrong over there.

15:21.510 --> 15:22.320
His Highness has said

15:22.320 --> 15:24.580
that Hanyu Courtyard lies
too close to Baoshi Hall.

15:24.580 --> 15:26.390
The late Duke spent his life
on the battlefield,

15:26.390 --> 15:28.100
burdened with too much bloodshed.

15:28.100 --> 15:30.000
Madam Chang may have been affected by it,

15:30.000 --> 15:32.130
which is why her illness has lingered.

15:32.260 --> 15:34.080
Asking Madam Chang to move to Yunzhen Hall

15:34.080 --> 15:35.350
is also for the sake

15:35.370 --> 15:36.560
of her health.

15:36.980 --> 15:38.290
You scoundrel,

15:38.470 --> 15:40.000
telling such blatant lies.

15:40.240 --> 15:42.120
Yunzhen Hall is secluded

15:42.550 --> 15:44.670
and sits right beside
the servants' quarters.

15:44.670 --> 15:46.670
It has always been noisy and unruly.

15:46.970 --> 15:47.490
You...

15:48.650 --> 15:49.390
Madam Zheng.

15:52.320 --> 15:53.050
Steward Xue.

15:53.840 --> 15:56.250
Madam Chang has just taken her medicine
and lain down to rest.

15:56.250 --> 15:58.050
Waking her up now

15:58.160 --> 16:00.020
is not what we servants should do.

16:00.440 --> 16:02.840
Please, Steward Xue, show some mercy

16:03.230 --> 16:05.040
and go back to report to the Duke first.

16:05.040 --> 16:06.170
Once Madam awakens,

16:06.280 --> 16:07.940
we will certainly inform her.

16:08.000 --> 16:09.590
We servants only follow orders.

16:09.590 --> 16:11.730
His Highness commanded that
the move be made at around one-fifteen,

16:11.730 --> 16:13.610
and we dare not delay for even a moment.

16:13.610 --> 16:15.930
After all, the Duke's orders
are as firm as mountains.

16:15.930 --> 16:17.780
No matter how much you care for Madam,

16:17.780 --> 16:19.980
you wouldn't have me beaten, would you?

16:22.390 --> 16:23.000
You can't go!

16:23.000 --> 16:23.480
Steward Xue!

16:23.480 --> 16:24.960
You can't go! You can't!

16:24.960 --> 16:26.720
Don't go in there!

16:27.360 --> 16:29.080
Steward Xue! Steward Xue!

16:29.630 --> 16:31.420
You cannot go in there!

16:31.450 --> 16:33.140
You cannot go in there!

16:46.800 --> 16:47.470
Madam.

16:47.680 --> 16:48.810
Why are you out here?

16:51.390 --> 16:53.820
I am here on the Duke's orders.

16:54.140 --> 16:56.420
He sent you to force me to relocate?

16:56.630 --> 16:57.390
His Highness

16:57.390 --> 16:58.960
is concerned about your health, Madam.

16:58.960 --> 16:59.800
He said that

16:59.820 --> 17:02.120
the ancients taught that
even in great thirst or hunger,

17:02.120 --> 17:03.720
excess must be avoided.

17:04.000 --> 17:04.900
Madam Chang, your illness

17:04.900 --> 17:06.630
is the result of immoderation.

17:06.829 --> 17:08.660
Excess leads to indigestion,

17:08.930 --> 17:11.160
disrupting the balance
of blood and vital energy.

17:11.160 --> 17:12.700
Yunzhen Hall is quiet and secluded,

17:12.700 --> 17:13.880
making it ideal for convalescence.

17:13.880 --> 17:16.089
From now on, a simple diet
of rice congee and vegetables,

17:16.089 --> 17:17.569
and handling everything personally

17:17.569 --> 17:19.300
will help restore your health.

17:19.790 --> 17:20.920
You cannot go there.

17:23.440 --> 17:24.640
I'm just a guest here,

17:24.750 --> 17:26.210
so I shouldn't interfere.

17:26.510 --> 17:27.480
But you can.

17:28.160 --> 17:29.960
Madam Chang is extremely proud.

17:30.200 --> 17:31.550
She would never allow her juniors

17:31.550 --> 17:33.550
to see her in such a miserable state.

17:33.880 --> 17:35.280
As her daughter-in-law,

17:35.790 --> 17:37.460
I cannot damage her dignity even more.

17:37.460 --> 17:39.520
The mistress of this noble household

17:39.830 --> 17:41.400
is being forced by servants

17:41.590 --> 17:42.850
to relocate while ill.

17:43.440 --> 17:45.440
Yet she still clings to her dignity.

17:45.980 --> 17:47.440
What sense does that make?

17:47.880 --> 17:50.140
Madam Chang comes from
a prestigious scholarly family.

17:50.140 --> 17:52.470
Her grandfather was once the Grand Tutor.

17:52.660 --> 17:55.260
Steward Xue wouldn't dare
offend her too much.

17:58.330 --> 17:59.410
When has he ever

17:59.890 --> 18:01.760
treated me so well?

18:03.590 --> 18:04.480
Or is he afraid

18:05.370 --> 18:07.440
I might die here in the courtyard

18:07.930 --> 18:09.610
and bring him bad luck,

18:09.810 --> 18:11.570
shortening his lifespan?

18:15.430 --> 18:16.700
I wouldn't dare trouble you, Madam.

18:16.700 --> 18:17.980
I'll help you move.

18:20.300 --> 18:22.160
Who gave you permission
to stand here grinning,

18:22.160 --> 18:23.240
talking out of turn

18:23.350 --> 18:24.200
and showing no respect?

18:24.200 --> 18:25.640
Do you have no manners at all?

18:25.640 --> 18:27.400
Every generation's mistress
of the Xue household

18:27.400 --> 18:29.000
has lived in this courtyard.

18:29.210 --> 18:30.850
I was also married into the Xue family

18:30.850 --> 18:32.410
with full propriety.

18:33.100 --> 18:34.140
If Xue Maotang

18:34.740 --> 18:36.500
wants me to move elsewhere,

18:37.200 --> 18:39.030
let him come and tell me himself.

18:40.030 --> 18:41.920
You servants have no right

18:41.920 --> 18:43.200
to give orders here.

18:43.680 --> 18:44.710
Madam Chang.

18:44.730 --> 18:45.290
Get lost!

18:46.230 --> 18:48.310
You heartless, treacherous wretch.

18:48.490 --> 18:49.180
Get out now!

18:49.400 --> 18:51.310
You whisper slanders
into your master's ear every day.

18:51.310 --> 18:54.170
Heaven's thunder will strike
you dead eventually!

18:59.400 --> 19:00.050
Madam Chang.

19:00.050 --> 19:00.730
Madam.

19:01.310 --> 19:02.510
Please go rest.

19:13.840 --> 19:15.370
I apologize for this scene.

19:15.500 --> 19:17.830
After Madam Chang has freshened up,

19:18.270 --> 19:19.550
you can visit her then.

19:19.950 --> 19:21.610
You didn't do anything wrong,

19:21.830 --> 19:23.350
so why apologize?

19:40.880 --> 19:43.800
This red ginseng has fine striations
and a brocaded surface,

19:43.800 --> 19:45.250
is perfectly balanced
in the five elements,

19:45.250 --> 19:46.450
and full of vitality.

19:47.010 --> 19:48.540
This is indeed a top-grade,

19:48.680 --> 19:50.920
century-old wild ginseng.

19:52.000 --> 19:52.880
Miss Rong.

19:54.270 --> 19:55.550
You're very thoughtful.

19:55.550 --> 19:58.080
Madam, you're my elder
and very magnanimous.

19:58.310 --> 20:00.840
I hope you won't mind
my earlier discourtesy.

20:13.300 --> 20:13.980
Mother!

20:14.000 --> 20:14.890
Madam Chang!

20:16.470 --> 20:17.360
Madam.

20:35.920 --> 20:36.560
Mother.

20:37.480 --> 20:38.350
You're awake.

20:38.750 --> 20:40.080
Are you feeling better?

20:40.880 --> 20:42.410
The doctor will be here soon.

20:42.410 --> 20:43.680
I don't want a doctor.

20:44.660 --> 20:46.150
Make them all leave.

20:46.790 --> 20:47.470
Out.

20:48.870 --> 20:50.070
You all may leave now.

20:54.310 --> 20:55.900
Madam Chang's agitation
has stirred heart fire,

20:55.900 --> 20:57.350
causing hot phlegm to rise

20:57.350 --> 20:58.810
and her head to feel dizzy.

20:58.940 --> 21:01.100
A thin slice of the blood ginseng

21:01.370 --> 21:02.600
placed beneath the tongue

21:02.600 --> 21:04.240
will clear heat and calm the heart.

21:04.240 --> 21:04.830
Yes.

21:06.400 --> 21:08.200
Mrs. Xue, I'll take my leave now.

21:08.640 --> 21:10.440
Please rest and recover, Madam.

21:10.440 --> 21:12.770
Getting angry will only harm your health.

21:13.980 --> 21:14.740
Stand there.

21:23.110 --> 21:24.910
If you have any requests, Madam,

21:24.910 --> 21:26.860
please wait until you've recovered.

21:26.860 --> 21:28.200
You should speak less now

21:28.200 --> 21:30.000
to avoid depleting your energy.

21:33.270 --> 21:34.070
Come here.

21:44.670 --> 21:45.930
I don't need your help.

21:46.450 --> 21:49.050
So you won't bring out
your jade seal again.

21:49.590 --> 21:50.590
Aren't you afraid

21:51.050 --> 21:54.180
people will say
you're using your power to bully others?

21:56.550 --> 21:57.160
Madam.

21:57.580 --> 22:00.320
Political tactics are for
dealing with usurpers.

22:00.320 --> 22:02.600
Knives are for dealing with bandits.

22:03.160 --> 22:05.430
In business, harmony comes first.

22:06.070 --> 22:07.600
My grandmother always says

22:07.630 --> 22:09.290
that whatever method you use,

22:09.310 --> 22:12.070
adapting to circumstances
is the key to victory.

22:12.970 --> 22:15.080
The Duke's household
chose to rely on power first,

22:15.080 --> 22:17.080
so I had no choice but to follow suit.

22:17.160 --> 22:18.410
For any offense I've caused,

22:18.410 --> 22:20.070
please don't take it to heart.

22:20.380 --> 22:22.820
Old Madam Rong,

22:23.510 --> 22:25.170
or rather, your grandmother,

22:25.810 --> 22:27.720
I am indeed most curious to know

22:28.070 --> 22:29.640
what manner of woman she is.

22:30.310 --> 22:31.160
How could she raise

22:31.160 --> 22:33.220
such an unruly granddaughter as you?

22:34.750 --> 22:36.750
If you were born in the Chang family,

22:37.270 --> 22:39.330
and dared to contradict your elders,

22:39.340 --> 22:41.620
they would pull out your teeth,

22:41.960 --> 22:44.750
so that you would be
too ashamed to speak again.

22:45.110 --> 22:45.680
Well,

22:47.150 --> 22:49.400
I'm also proud to
be born in the Rong family.

22:49.400 --> 22:50.200
In our family,

22:50.400 --> 22:52.750
daughters who are meek and fearful

22:53.240 --> 22:55.640
would have been
beaten harshly by Grandmother.

22:55.640 --> 22:58.440
Madam Chang, you should rest well,

22:58.640 --> 23:00.310
lest I speak out of turn again

23:00.440 --> 23:01.880
and anger you further.

23:02.320 --> 23:03.580
That would be my fault.

23:03.910 --> 23:06.500
Mother, Miss Rong is right.

23:07.110 --> 23:08.110
You should lie down for a while.

23:08.110 --> 23:10.370
I haven't finished asking my questions.

23:13.790 --> 23:16.270
Madam Chang,
what exactly do you want to ask?

23:19.340 --> 23:20.540
Has your grandmother

23:21.590 --> 23:24.790
really never married?

23:27.550 --> 23:28.790
She never married,

23:29.160 --> 23:30.720
nor was she ever married off.

23:30.720 --> 23:31.890
By your logic,

23:32.290 --> 23:33.820
I have three grandfathers.

23:34.530 --> 23:35.420
Miss Rong.

23:36.030 --> 23:37.240
Don't ever say

23:37.240 --> 23:38.720
such shocking words
in front of Madam Chang.

23:38.720 --> 23:39.720
Let her speak.

23:40.300 --> 23:41.960
Divorces happen all the time.

23:42.370 --> 23:44.440
But it's not something to be proud of.

23:45.070 --> 23:47.400
This is the first time

23:48.240 --> 23:50.850
I've heard someone
speak so boldly about it.

23:52.110 --> 23:54.110
With the wealth and status
of our Rong family,

23:54.110 --> 23:55.570
if Grandmother were truly

23:55.610 --> 23:57.270
after young and handsome men,

23:57.550 --> 23:59.400
it would be easy for her to have a few.

23:59.400 --> 24:00.400
But she said that

24:00.920 --> 24:02.420
what matters is mutual affection

24:02.420 --> 24:03.950
and a harmonious marriage.

24:03.960 --> 24:05.720
Even if you asked her to find another,

24:05.720 --> 24:07.640
she would find it too troublesome.

24:07.640 --> 24:09.480
Unfortunately, fate is unpredictable,

24:09.480 --> 24:11.080
always leading her to the wrong people

24:11.080 --> 24:12.610
and denying her happiness.

24:12.680 --> 24:14.490
So she had no choice but to turn back

24:14.490 --> 24:16.350
and find another suitable match.

24:16.720 --> 24:17.830
In a lifetime,

24:18.160 --> 24:19.960
to meet even one true lover

24:20.310 --> 24:22.070
is fortune enough.

24:22.680 --> 24:24.030
For those who indulge in pleasures

24:24.030 --> 24:25.080
and passions,

24:25.880 --> 24:27.880
having ten lovers is no excess.

24:28.620 --> 24:30.880
Spring brings warmth and flowers bloom.

24:31.090 --> 24:33.280
Winter comes and the rivers freeze.

24:33.960 --> 24:36.200
Reunions and partings are inevitable.

24:36.640 --> 24:38.970
It's best to let things take their course.

24:44.370 --> 24:46.410
Madam, I'll take my leave now.

24:54.750 --> 24:55.510
Wan.

24:56.790 --> 24:58.160
Did you hear that?

25:00.250 --> 25:02.580
I never imagined there could be

25:03.840 --> 25:05.600
such a woman in this world.

25:07.370 --> 25:09.370
The way she just spoke to me

25:09.780 --> 25:10.920
was so different.

25:12.270 --> 25:15.790
You all saw what just happened.

25:23.380 --> 25:26.240
Living to this day,

25:26.860 --> 25:29.030
I have to endure a little girl

25:29.390 --> 25:31.910
pitying me.

25:36.790 --> 25:38.030
How ridiculous.

25:39.870 --> 25:40.430
Mother.

25:41.400 --> 25:43.350
Miss Rong is broad-minded.

25:43.790 --> 25:45.920
Though she doesn't always
follow proper etiquette,

25:45.920 --> 25:47.580
she is a kind-hearted person.

25:47.590 --> 25:48.990
She's standing up for you

25:49.020 --> 25:51.080
and won't spread this matter around.

25:51.590 --> 25:55.550
Everyone was once young,

25:55.790 --> 25:56.920
charming, and fair.

25:58.250 --> 26:00.440
Yet my parents reproached me

26:00.440 --> 26:02.570
for being too alluring and seductive.

26:03.160 --> 26:04.820
So they shaved off my eyebrows

26:05.430 --> 26:06.980
and bound my feet,

26:08.030 --> 26:11.310
teaching me to be proper, obedient,

26:11.690 --> 26:13.720
and cautious in speech and behavior.

26:13.720 --> 26:15.850
But when I married into the Xue family,

26:16.270 --> 26:17.440
he said that

26:18.590 --> 26:21.030
in all my movements and expressions,

26:21.480 --> 26:23.340
I followed the rules too rigidly.

26:23.480 --> 26:25.480
I could not compare to his late wife,

26:26.310 --> 26:28.720
who was beautiful, cheerful

26:29.200 --> 26:32.630
and skilled in all the arts, from music
and chess to calligraphy and painting.

26:32.630 --> 26:34.430
He called me a block of stone,

26:35.240 --> 26:38.510
a calculating mind.

26:39.910 --> 26:40.980
He said

26:41.590 --> 26:43.330
I did not know how to please him,

26:46.200 --> 26:49.310
and was not romantic enough.

26:51.550 --> 26:53.480
So after just ten days of marriage,

26:54.770 --> 26:56.580
he never came to my room again.

26:57.960 --> 26:58.750
And me?

26:59.130 --> 27:00.060
All these years,

27:01.530 --> 27:03.290
I've managed his household,

27:04.400 --> 27:05.670
worked endlessly,

27:06.870 --> 27:08.540
upheld his reputation,

27:08.850 --> 27:13.280
and brought one concubine
after another for him

27:14.010 --> 27:15.810
over the course of twenty years.

27:18.940 --> 27:20.350
My husband...

27:21.960 --> 27:23.240
My husband

27:24.310 --> 27:26.270
has been dead for twenty years.

27:28.250 --> 27:31.250
Madam, you must be losing your mind!

27:31.750 --> 27:32.590
You can't say

27:32.760 --> 27:34.880
things like that in front of others.

27:35.020 --> 27:38.650
What's there to hide anymore?

27:39.200 --> 27:39.790
Mother.

27:40.210 --> 27:42.300
Mother, please don't continue.

27:42.880 --> 27:44.280
Don't let others hear it.

27:51.960 --> 27:52.720
Well.

27:55.140 --> 27:57.530
Your life is even harder than mine.

27:59.310 --> 28:02.550
The Duke's household is prestigious,

28:03.070 --> 28:04.550
wealthy and bustling.

28:05.880 --> 28:08.510
But what do I have to do
with their family bonds?

28:10.470 --> 28:11.270
I...

28:12.750 --> 28:15.030
I subsist on mere meals,

28:16.040 --> 28:17.330
yet he refuses

28:18.680 --> 28:20.790
to give me a courtyard

28:20.790 --> 28:22.110
to live in.

28:23.140 --> 28:24.680
Why should I

28:24.680 --> 28:26.550
keep up appearances for him?

28:28.110 --> 28:29.870
Why should I?

28:31.120 --> 28:33.190
Mother, you're tired.

28:33.610 --> 28:35.940
I'll come pay my respects again tomorrow.

28:37.010 --> 28:37.730
Wan.

28:40.090 --> 28:40.930
Your fate

28:42.680 --> 28:44.280
is a little better than mine.

28:46.310 --> 28:47.000
At least

28:49.270 --> 28:50.310
you have a son

28:50.940 --> 28:52.940
who can inherit the title.

29:15.450 --> 29:16.180
Nanny.

29:19.240 --> 29:20.200
I'm so tired.

29:21.400 --> 29:22.480
Madam Chang.

29:25.620 --> 29:26.540
I'm so tired.

29:43.160 --> 29:44.430
[Fuping Pavilion]

29:54.590 --> 29:55.510
-Please spare my life. Master Shuyu.
-Please spare my life. Master Shuyu.

29:55.510 --> 29:56.440
Please spare my life.

29:56.440 --> 30:00.570
-Please spare my life. Master Shuyu.
-Please spare my life. Master Shuyu.

30:11.710 --> 30:12.310
Get out!

30:15.930 --> 30:17.030
Get out now.

30:18.240 --> 30:18.930
Yes.

30:18.960 --> 30:20.090
I told you to get out!

30:21.550 --> 30:23.070
Why are you mad at me?

30:24.110 --> 30:25.400
It wasn't me who made father

30:25.400 --> 30:26.270
punish you.

30:28.310 --> 30:30.770
You're clearly the one
stirring up trouble.

30:30.940 --> 30:32.920
If you hadn't provoked Rong Shanbao,

30:32.920 --> 30:34.850
why would Father have punished me?

30:38.920 --> 30:40.380
Because you're disabled,

30:41.310 --> 30:41.880
stripped of

30:41.880 --> 30:43.680
your right to inherit the title,

30:44.410 --> 30:46.610
everything bad in this house

30:47.200 --> 30:49.000
is automatically blamed on you.

30:54.880 --> 30:56.320
Why are you mad at me?

30:57.000 --> 30:57.600
You should

30:58.510 --> 30:59.720
blame your mother

30:59.720 --> 31:01.120
for giving you a brother.

31:06.380 --> 31:07.710
Even without the title,

31:08.550 --> 31:09.950
I'm still the Duke's son,

31:10.350 --> 31:12.750
the Eldest Young Master of this household.

31:16.660 --> 31:17.940
You fool.

31:18.720 --> 31:19.780
You don't know that

31:20.640 --> 31:21.720
Lu Jianglai

31:22.000 --> 31:24.530
has been locked in
the Daiyan Tower by Father.

31:24.710 --> 31:26.040
The longer he holds out,

31:27.440 --> 31:30.520
the more danger you're in.

31:32.550 --> 31:34.550
If Lu Jianglai agrees, that's fine.

31:35.090 --> 31:37.410
But if he keeps refusing...

31:38.740 --> 31:39.590
What happens

31:41.310 --> 31:42.440
if he doesn't agree?

31:43.270 --> 31:44.640
The emotional cannot achieve great deeds,

31:44.640 --> 31:46.270
and the compassionate
cannot command armies.

31:46.270 --> 31:48.130
Father is ruthless and decisive,

31:48.160 --> 31:49.490
strict beyond measure.

31:49.880 --> 31:51.400
He spares no one

31:52.160 --> 31:53.990
who disobeys his will.

31:54.590 --> 31:56.350
If Lu Jianglai refuses,

31:56.880 --> 31:59.610
it must be out of concern
for your brotherly bond.

32:00.030 --> 32:02.270
He does not wish to bear the blame

32:03.740 --> 32:04.720
for usurping your title

32:04.720 --> 32:06.180
while you are still alive.

32:06.900 --> 32:07.530
But

32:10.200 --> 32:10.790
can you

32:12.480 --> 32:13.880
really live long enough?

32:15.410 --> 32:16.010
No.

32:18.110 --> 32:18.910
He won't do it.

32:19.680 --> 32:20.310
He won't.

32:26.320 --> 32:27.430
Is that really so?

32:34.010 --> 32:35.270
Others might not know,

32:35.750 --> 32:36.790
but you do.

32:37.760 --> 32:40.520
Back then, it was you who reported

32:41.610 --> 32:43.970
the secret affair between
his favorite Madam Fang,

32:43.970 --> 32:45.830
and the steward of the household.

32:46.790 --> 32:47.550
Have you forgotten

32:47.550 --> 32:48.790
that how Father

32:49.530 --> 32:50.770
dealt with them?

32:51.990 --> 32:52.840
That woman

32:53.480 --> 32:54.340
was eventually

32:56.500 --> 32:58.430
driven insane by fear.

33:00.170 --> 33:02.720
Weren't you so scared that

33:02.750 --> 33:04.680
you couldn't sleep for half a year?

33:08.310 --> 33:11.440
Father then scolded you for being
weak and incompetent,

33:11.690 --> 33:13.790
unable to stand the slightest bloodshed,

33:13.790 --> 33:15.510
nothing like his son at all.

33:17.480 --> 33:18.610
But look at this now.

33:20.680 --> 33:21.880
A proper son has come.

33:23.030 --> 33:25.830
He is talented in all matters,
resolute and brave.

33:25.960 --> 33:26.920
I heard that

33:27.190 --> 33:27.750
he handled

33:27.750 --> 33:29.310
the affairs in Linji so well

33:30.250 --> 33:32.250
that he earned the Emperor's favor.

33:34.200 --> 33:35.350
My dear brother,

33:37.080 --> 33:39.160
who is truly the Xue Shuyu?

33:40.890 --> 33:42.200
It's him, isn't it?

33:48.910 --> 33:50.370
If you don't get rid of him,

33:51.170 --> 33:52.830
you'll be the one who suffers.

34:11.070 --> 34:12.280
My dear brother.

34:14.600 --> 34:18.480
I feel so sorry for you.

34:30.190 --> 34:30.800
Then

34:32.550 --> 34:33.489
what should I do?

35:00.910 --> 35:01.640
This is nice.

35:23.190 --> 35:23.920
How do I look?

35:25.620 --> 35:27.390
Surely you're a refined gentleman,

35:27.390 --> 35:28.650
handsome and elegant.

35:30.670 --> 35:31.670
Then will you come

35:32.190 --> 35:32.760
with me?

35:36.320 --> 35:37.980
You brothers will surely wish

35:38.510 --> 35:40.040
to talk long into the night.

35:40.750 --> 35:41.680
There are things

35:42.510 --> 35:44.840
best not said before others.

35:51.110 --> 35:53.480
Yunyin has been much more obedient lately,

35:53.480 --> 35:54.630
listening to Yunxi

35:55.670 --> 35:57.840
and diligently studying tea-healing.

35:57.840 --> 35:59.550
Next month, I plan

35:59.550 --> 36:01.350
to send her out with the tea team.

36:01.670 --> 36:03.630
Only by understanding
the hard work of her elder sisters

36:03.630 --> 36:05.360
will she become more sensible.

36:05.960 --> 36:07.360
This is all thanks to you.

36:08.240 --> 36:09.300
I'm very grateful.

36:12.320 --> 36:13.840
It's all thanks to your guidance.

36:13.840 --> 36:15.640
I wouldn't dare take the credit.

36:15.760 --> 36:16.820
You keep telling me

36:17.800 --> 36:19.840
that unending leniency among sisters

36:19.840 --> 36:21.170
will only cause trouble

36:21.400 --> 36:22.400
and create rifts.

36:23.030 --> 36:24.340
And that perfect sisterly affection

36:24.340 --> 36:25.470
is also impossible.

36:30.440 --> 36:32.760
Bao, thank you for reminding me.

36:34.590 --> 36:35.510
I've never tied

36:35.840 --> 36:37.570
a scented sachet for any man before.

36:37.570 --> 36:38.570
You're the first.

36:45.510 --> 36:46.640
Wait for me tonight.

36:47.030 --> 36:48.920
I have something important to tell you.

36:48.920 --> 36:49.720
Be careful.

37:13.310 --> 37:14.140
This piece

37:15.440 --> 37:17.040
was left by Mother years ago.

37:18.350 --> 37:20.680
Unfortunately, it's only half complete.

37:21.000 --> 37:22.320
After Mother passed away,

37:22.320 --> 37:24.110
no one played it anymore.

37:25.360 --> 37:26.550
I felt it a great pity

37:27.190 --> 37:30.050
and sought many people
to complete the second half,

37:30.170 --> 37:32.230
but none could do it satisfactorily.

37:32.630 --> 37:35.190
Eventually I decided to compose it myself.

37:36.080 --> 37:37.080
What do you think?

37:38.510 --> 37:39.840
The piece you completed

37:40.830 --> 37:41.760
is excellent.

37:45.400 --> 37:47.200
The first half is full of spirit,

37:47.290 --> 37:48.620
graceful and delicate.

37:49.030 --> 37:50.870
The second half is technically sound,

37:50.870 --> 37:52.670
but lacks the same inspiration.

37:52.960 --> 37:54.360
My talent is limited.

37:55.190 --> 37:57.560
I failed to inherit
Mother's artistic gifts.

37:57.560 --> 37:59.360
What I added is but a poor extension,

37:59.360 --> 38:01.220
and is likely to invite ridicule.

38:01.670 --> 38:04.060
She was extraordinarily talented.

38:04.760 --> 38:08.360
At sixteen, her writings had already
made her famous in the capital.

38:08.360 --> 38:10.030
How many women of such talent

38:10.670 --> 38:12.800
and beauty exist today?

38:14.030 --> 38:14.760
I'm merely

38:14.760 --> 38:15.920
using this piece

38:16.170 --> 38:17.190
to express my

38:17.190 --> 38:18.400
longing for her.

38:20.400 --> 38:21.320
Mother?

38:22.150 --> 38:23.950
Who exactly is your real mother?

38:24.430 --> 38:25.070
That woman who nearly

38:25.070 --> 38:26.930
drove your birth mother to death?

38:27.360 --> 38:28.690
You've come all this way

38:28.890 --> 38:30.960
and won't even take a single cup of wine.

38:30.960 --> 38:32.820
What kind of sense does that make?

38:33.150 --> 38:34.190
Drink this one,

38:35.070 --> 38:36.530
and I'll pour you another.

38:56.550 --> 38:57.030
Xun.

38:57.370 --> 38:57.850
Come.

38:58.920 --> 38:59.780
Come over here.

39:00.190 --> 39:01.110
Come to me.

39:02.930 --> 39:04.030
Your father is looking for you.

39:04.030 --> 39:04.630
Just go.

39:09.000 --> 39:09.860
Xun, come here.

39:11.630 --> 39:12.630
This is your Uncle Jianglai.

39:12.630 --> 39:13.230
Greet him.

39:13.840 --> 39:15.710
Are you Xun?

39:17.280 --> 39:18.880
Xun, say hello.

39:19.660 --> 39:21.060
Call him Uncle Jianglai.

39:21.760 --> 39:23.590
Xun, say hello.

39:27.780 --> 39:29.580
It's his first time meeting you,

39:29.630 --> 39:30.760
so he's a little shy.

39:30.880 --> 39:32.540
Please don't mind, Jianglai.

39:32.570 --> 39:33.170
It's fine.

39:37.050 --> 39:37.610
Xun.

39:39.840 --> 39:40.230
Here.

39:42.810 --> 39:44.010
Take this and go play.

39:45.110 --> 39:45.590
Go.

39:54.960 --> 39:56.360
At such a young age,

39:57.230 --> 39:59.690
Xun dares to embarrass
his father in public.

39:59.960 --> 40:00.800
You've raised such a

40:00.800 --> 40:01.920
disobedient son.

40:02.400 --> 40:05.550
As his mother, you are to blame.

40:06.820 --> 40:08.480
Hurry and offer Jianglai a cup

40:08.550 --> 40:09.350
to apologize.

40:10.810 --> 40:12.410
What are you all standing there for?

40:12.410 --> 40:14.010
Keep singing! Keep dancing!

40:54.910 --> 40:56.790
Other wives serve their husbands

40:57.360 --> 40:59.320
like subjects serving their lord,

40:59.800 --> 41:02.060
respectful and obedient in everything.

41:02.320 --> 41:03.110
But you?

41:03.670 --> 41:06.270
When I'm enjoying
family time with my brother,

41:06.270 --> 41:07.800
you sulk, and deliberately

41:07.880 --> 41:08.960
try to ruin my mood!

41:09.880 --> 41:12.260
You've taught Xun
to disrespect his elders,

41:12.260 --> 41:14.320
and turned him into a timid, weak boy.

41:15.510 --> 41:16.280
Are you deaf?

41:17.510 --> 41:18.690
If Jianglai won't drink,

41:18.690 --> 41:20.150
then just persuade him to!

41:20.190 --> 41:20.760
Shuyu.

41:22.710 --> 41:23.770
In front of others,

41:24.190 --> 41:25.960
you should show respect to Huiqing.

41:25.960 --> 41:26.800
How could you order her

41:26.800 --> 41:28.940
to offer drinks
in front of all these dancers?

41:28.940 --> 41:30.000
That's not proper.

41:31.080 --> 41:34.460
Huiqing, just forget about it.

41:39.630 --> 41:40.190
No way!

41:43.300 --> 41:45.320
Father always praises you
for being virtuous,

41:45.320 --> 41:46.150
yet I can't even get you

41:46.150 --> 41:47.710
to offer a single cup of wine.

41:47.710 --> 41:49.710
What kind of virtuous woman are you?

41:55.940 --> 41:57.490
I'm not a virtuous woman,

41:58.710 --> 42:00.770
and you're not a virtuous man either.

42:01.590 --> 42:02.550
Perhaps I committed

42:02.550 --> 42:04.080
too many sins in my past life

42:04.080 --> 42:04.670
to be condemned

42:04.670 --> 42:06.730
to marry into your miserable family!

42:08.380 --> 42:09.310
What did you say?

42:09.680 --> 42:11.140
Shuyu, what are you doing?

42:28.590 --> 42:29.590
Everyone, leave.

42:30.340 --> 42:31.670
Whoever dares to leak this matter

42:31.670 --> 42:33.190
or gossip about it privately,

42:33.190 --> 42:34.190
if even a word

42:34.190 --> 42:35.000
reaches me,

42:35.710 --> 42:36.840
I will show no mercy.

42:37.510 --> 42:38.440
Yes.

42:55.130 --> 42:57.190
Jianglai, you're quite impressive,

42:57.890 --> 42:59.820
giving orders in my courtyard now.

43:12.190 --> 43:12.960
Shuyu.

43:14.640 --> 43:15.770
You're truly drunk.

43:21.120 --> 43:21.640
Right.

43:23.440 --> 43:24.840
I've had too much to drink

43:24.840 --> 43:25.840
and misspoke.

43:27.250 --> 43:28.980
Jianglai, don't take offense.

43:29.320 --> 43:31.650
I've just recently come to the household.

43:31.780 --> 43:33.610
But Huiqing comes from a noble family

43:33.610 --> 43:35.140
and is gentle and virtuous.

43:35.600 --> 43:37.330
She attends to you personally

43:37.560 --> 43:38.560
with utmost care.

43:39.040 --> 43:40.640
Everyone here respects her.

43:41.110 --> 43:42.970
No matter how displeased you are,

43:43.110 --> 43:44.710
you shouldn't embarrass her

43:45.030 --> 43:45.920
in front of others.
